abstract: >-
  APERTURE performs few-shot target-domain adaptation of frozen vision–language
  models using a reusable, support-fitted representation-level visual lens
  over selected visual-token key/value activations. It does not update backbone
  weights, retain support activations, or perform per-query optimization.
keywords:
  - vision-language models
  - few-shot adaptation
  - target-domain adaptation
  - representation-level adaptation
  - frozen backbones
  - visual evidence
